# Path to the JSON timeline store the API reads and writes.
#
# Point this at your own data file — the one the Excel importer writes:
# DATA_FILE_PATH='/path/to/timeline-data.json'
#
# Or, to run against the fabricated sample data, use the copy in the build output. The
# build refreshes it every time, so writes never dirty the checked-in file:
# DATA_FILE_PATH='./bin/Debug/net10.0/test/sample-01.json'
#
# Note: dotenv.net OVERWRITES real environment variables, so exporting DATA_FILE_PATH in
# your shell will not override this file. Edit it here instead.
#
# A missing file or an unset value fails at startup with an explicit message rather than
# quietly serving an empty timeline.
